00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:12.620
I don't wanna play this game!

00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:15.500
I don't wanna play it! I don't wanna play it. I do. Not. Want to. Play it.

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:16.000
