Mark: "AH! EEEAH! OK!!"

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:41.440
Mark: I'm out! I'M OUT!! Ooooooo!
*slams door*

00:01:41.440 --> 00:01:43.480
AHH! No! De- Da- WAH!

00:01:43.480 --> 00:01:44.020
NO!

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:46.860
WOAH! WOAH! WOAH! WOAH! WOAH!

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:47.820
WOAH!

00:01:48.640 --> 00:01:49.480
Wow!

